{
  "_comment": [
    "Shared fixture pinning the most-recent-assistant-turn boundary across the",
    "two implementations that must agree on it:",
    "  - `most_recent_assistant_turn_start` in crates/daemon/src/content_util.rs",
    "    (the boundary `replay_prior_thinking` strips against), and",
    "  - `mostRecentAssistantTurnStart` in",
    "    llm-sidecar/src/llm/providers/anthropic.ts (the boundary the",
    "    Anthropic cache breakpoint is anchored just before).",
    "If they drift, the anchor lands inside the region the strip rewrites, both",
    "message breakpoints miss, and every committed turn silently re-caches the",
    "whole conversation. That failure has no other automated guard: the",
    "end-to-end check is an #[ignore] live provider probe.",
    "Consumed by content_util.rs::tests::turn_boundary_matches_shared_fixture and",
    "llm-sidecar/tests/turn_boundary_parity.test.ts.",
    "`expected` is the 0-based index at which the trailing assistant turn begins,",
    "or messages.length when there is no assistant message at all."
  ],
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "no messages",
      "expected": 0,
      "messages": []
    },
    {
      "name": "no assistant message: every message is strippable history",
      "expected": 2,
      "messages": [
        { "role": "user", "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "q1" }] },
        { "role": "user", "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "q2" }] }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "assistant at index 0",
      "expected": 0,
      "messages": [{ "role": "assistant", "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "a" }] }]
    },
    {
      "name": "single trailing assistant after a genuine user",
      "expected": 1,
      "messages": [
        { "role": "user", "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "q" }] },
        { "role": "assistant", "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "a" }] }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "consecutive assistants are one turn",
      "expected": 1,
      "messages": [
        { "role": "user", "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "q" }] },
        { "role": "assistant", "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "a1" }] },
        { "role": "assistant", "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "a2" }] }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "turn spans an interleaved tool-result-only user",
      "expected": 1,
      "messages": [
        { "role": "user", "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "q" }] },
        {
          "role": "assistant",
          "content": [{ "type": "tool_use", "id": "tu_1", "name": "s", "input": {} }]
        },
        {
          "role": "user",
          "content": [{ "type": "tool_result", "tool_use_id": "tu_1", "content": "ok" }]
        },
        { "role": "assistant", "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "done" }] }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "trailing tool_result after the last assistant does not move the start",
      "expected": 1,
      "messages": [
        { "role": "user", "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "q" }] },
        {
          "role": "assistant",
          "content": [{ "type": "tool_use", "id": "tu_1", "name": "s", "input": {} }]
        },
        {
          "role": "user",
          "content": [{ "type": "tool_result", "tool_use_id": "tu_1", "content": "ok" }]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "three-round tool loop is one turn, starting after the genuine user",
      "expected": 3,
      "messages": [
        { "role": "user", "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "q1" }] },
        { "role": "assistant", "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "a1" }] },
        { "role": "user", "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "compact now" }] },
        {
          "role": "assistant",
          "content": [{ "type": "tool_use", "id": "tu_1", "name": "c", "input": {} }]
        },
        {
          "role": "user",
          "content": [{ "type": "tool_result", "tool_use_id": "tu_1", "content": "1" }]
        },
        {
          "role": "assistant",
          "content": [{ "type": "tool_use", "id": "tu_2", "name": "c", "input": {} }]
        },
        {
          "role": "user",
          "content": [{ "type": "tool_result", "tool_use_id": "tu_2", "content": "2" }]
        },
        {
          "role": "assistant",
          "content": [{ "type": "tool_use", "id": "tu_3", "name": "c", "input": {} }]
        },
        {
          "role": "user",
          "content": [{ "type": "tool_result", "tool_use_id": "tu_3", "content": "3" }]
        },
        { "role": "assistant", "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "compacted" }] }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "tool_result plus text is a genuine user turn and ends the run",
      "expected": 3,
      "messages": [
        { "role": "user", "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "q" }] },
        {
          "role": "assistant",
          "content": [{ "type": "tool_use", "id": "tu_1", "name": "s", "input": {} }]
        },
        {
          "role": "user",
          "content": [
            { "type": "tool_result", "tool_use_id": "tu_1", "content": "ok" },
            { "type": "text", "text": "also do this" }
          ]
        },
        { "role": "assistant", "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "done" }] }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "empty content array is not tool-result-only, so it ends the run",
      "expected": 3,
      "messages": [
        { "role": "user", "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "q" }] },
        { "role": "assistant", "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "a" }] },
        { "role": "user", "content": [] },
        { "role": "assistant", "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "a2" }] }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "string content is not tool-result-only, so it ends the run",
      "expected": 3,
      "messages": [
        { "role": "user", "content": "q" },
        { "role": "assistant", "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "a" }] },
        { "role": "user", "content": "again" },
        { "role": "assistant", "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "a2" }] }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "image-only user boundary ends the run (caption-less attachment)",
      "expected": 3,
      "messages": [
        { "role": "user", "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "q" }] },
        { "role": "assistant", "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "a" }] },
        {
          "role": "user",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image",
              "source": { "type": "base64", "media_type": "image/png", "data": "AAAA" }
            }
          ]
        },
        { "role": "assistant", "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "a2" }] }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
